{"parse":{"title":"Avar Kriss","pageid":644796,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"title-eraicons\" style=\"float:right;position:static;display:none\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"This article details a subject that is considered canon.\"><img alt=\"This article details a subject that is considered canon.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/b/be/Premium-Eras-canon.png/revision/latest?cb=20170617140440\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Premium-Eras-canon.png\" data-image-key=\"Premium-Eras-canon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div><p><span class=\"mobileTopIcons\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"Canon\"><img alt=\"OnACanonArticle\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/47/OnACanonArticle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250314035517\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-image-key=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span>\n</p><div id=\"Update\" class=\"mobile-hide headertemplate messagebox noprint iumb hidable\" style=\"background: #EEE8AA; color: #000; border-radius:10px\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0px\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"iumb-table-container\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"hidable-content\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"iumb-icon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Z-95_Headhunter.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20080821014929\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Z-95 Headhunter\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Z-95 Headhunter.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Z-95_Headhunter.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Z-95_Headhunter.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20080821014929\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"iumb-main\">\n<p><span class=\"iumb-caption\">Content approaching.</span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"iumb-message\">Parts of this article are no longer up to date. This article needs updating from multiple sources. Click the dropdown below to see the full list.<br /><div class=\"hidable start-hidden\">\n<div style=\"width: 70%; padding-left: 1em\"><span class=\"hidable-button\"></span> Sources</div>\n<div class=\"hidable-content\">\n<p><i><a href=\"/wiki/What_a_Jedi_Makes\" title=\"What a Jedi Makes\">What a Jedi Makes</a>, <span class=\"mhi\"><span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Young_Jedi_Adventures\" title=\"Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures\"><img alt=\"Star Wars Young Jedi Adventures template logo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Wars Young Jedi Adventures template logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Wars_Young_Jedi_Adventures_template_logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/25/Star_Wars_Young_Jedi_Adventures_template_logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/21?cb=20230218020310\" /></a></span></span> </i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Young_Jedi_Adventures\" title=\"Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures\">Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures</a><i> &#8212; \"<a href=\"/wiki/Clash\" title=\"Clash\">Clash</a>\", <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_High_Republic:_There_is_No_Fear\" title=\"Star Wars: The High Republic: There is No Fear\">Star Wars: The High Republic: There is No Fear</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Starlight:_Go_Together\" title=\"Starlight: Go Together\">Starlight: Go Together</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Starlight:_First_Duty\" title=\"Starlight: First Duty\">Starlight: First Duty</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_High_Republic:_Heart_of_the_Drengir\" title=\"Star Wars: The High Republic: Heart of the Drengir\">Star Wars: The High Republic: Heart of the Drengir</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_The_Rising_Storm\" title=\"The High Republic: The Rising Storm\">The High Republic: The Rising Storm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Out_of_the_Shadows\" title=\"The High Republic: Out of the Shadows\">The High Republic: Out of the Shadows</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Starlight:_Past_Mistakes\" title=\"Starlight: Past Mistakes\">Starlight: Past Mistakes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Tempest_Runner\" title=\"The High Republic: Tempest Runner\">The High Republic: Tempest Runner</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_High_Republic:_The_Shadow_of_the_Nihil\" title=\"Star Wars: The High Republic: The Shadow of the Nihil\">Star Wars: The High Republic: The Shadow of the Nihil</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_High_Republic:_Jedi%27s_End\" title=\"Star Wars: The High Republic: Jedi&#39;s End\">Star Wars: The High Republic: Jedi's End</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Trail_of_Shadows_3\" title=\"The High Republic: Trail of Shadows 3\">The High Republic: Trail of Shadows 3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic_Adventures:_Galactic_Bake-Off_Spectacular\" title=\"The High Republic Adventures: Galactic Bake-Off Spectacular\">The High Republic Adventures: Galactic Bake-Off Spectacular</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Mission_to_Disaster\" title=\"The High Republic: Mission to Disaster\">The High Republic: Mission to Disaster</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Starlight:_Shadows_Remain\" title=\"Starlight: Shadows Remain\">Starlight: Shadows Remain</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_The_Fallen_Star\" title=\"The High Republic: The Fallen Star\">The High Republic: The Fallen Star</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic_%E2%80%93_Shadows_of_Starlight_2\" title=\"The High Republic – Shadows of Starlight 2\">The High Republic – Shadows of Starlight 2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic_%E2%80%93_Shadows_of_Starlight_1\" title=\"The High Republic – Shadows of Starlight 1\">The High Republic – Shadows of Starlight 1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_The_Eye_of_Darkness\" title=\"The High Republic: The Eye of Darkness\">The High Republic: The Eye of Darkness</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Temptation_of_the_Force\" title=\"The High Republic: Temptation of the Force\">The High Republic: Temptation of the Force</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Tears_of_the_Nameless\" title=\"The High Republic: Tears of the Nameless\">The High Republic: Tears of the Nameless</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Beware_the_Nameless\" title=\"The High Republic: Beware the Nameless\">The High Republic: Beware the Nameless</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Tempest_Breaker\" title=\"The High Republic: Tempest Breaker\">The High Republic: Tempest Breaker</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Into_the_Light\" title=\"The High Republic: Into the Light\">The High Republic: Into the Light</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Trials_of_the_Jedi\" title=\"The High Republic: Trials of the Jedi\">The High Republic: Trials of the Jedi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Living_Force\" title=\"The Living Force\">The Living Force</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars_(2020)_20\" title=\"Star Wars (2020) 20\">Star Wars (2020) 20</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ahsoka_Tano_and_Other_Users_of_the_Force\" title=\"Ahsoka Tano and Other Users of the Force\">Ahsoka Tano and Other Users of the Force</a></i>\n</p>\n</div></div></span>\n<p><span class=\"iumb-comment\">Please update the article to include missing information, and remove this template when finished.</span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td class=\"iumb-hidable-button\"><span class=\"hidable-button\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-character pi-theme-Jedi pi-layout-default\">\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"imagefallback\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/e/e4/AvarKriss-SWULotF.png/revision/latest?cb=20260814230909\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"AvarKriss-SWULotF\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/e/e4/AvarKriss-SWULotF.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20260814230909\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/e/e4/AvarKriss-SWULotF.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20260814230909 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/e/e4/AvarKriss-SWULotF.png/revision/latest?cb=20260814230909 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"AvarKriss-SWULotF\" width=\"270\" height=\"360\" data-image-key=\"AvarKriss-SWULotF.png\" data-image-name=\"AvarKriss-SWULotF.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Avar Kriss</h2>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\" data-item-name=\"mobile-eras\"><center></center></nav>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Born</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">c. <a href=\"/wiki/262_BBY\" title=\"262 BBY\">262 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Date&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Date-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Descriptive information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Databank&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Databank-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gender\" title=\"Gender\">Female</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Databank&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Databank-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pronouns\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pronouns</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">She/her<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Inside&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Inside-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"height\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Height</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.73 <a href=\"/wiki/Meter\" title=\"Meter\">meters</a> (5 <a href=\"/wiki/Foot\" title=\"Foot\">ft</a>, 8 in)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-The&#95;High&#95;Republic&#95;Character&#95;Encyclopedia&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-The_High_Republic_Character_Encyclopedia-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hair\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hair color</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Color\" title=\"Color\">Blonde</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Announcement&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Announcement-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"eyes\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Eye color</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Brown<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Light&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Jedi&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Light_of_the_Jedi-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"skin\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Skin color</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Light<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Announcement&#95;5-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Announcement-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Family information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"partners\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Partner(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elzar_Mann\" title=\"Elzar Mann\">Elzar Mann</a> <small>(lover)</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Tempest&#95;Breaker&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Tempest_Breaker-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Chronological &amp; political information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order\" title=\"Jedi Order\">Jedi Order</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-The&#95;Rise&#95;of&#95;Kylo&#95;Ren&#95;3&#95;8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-The_Rise_of_Kylo_Ren_3-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Luminous_Nine\" title=\"Luminous Nine\">Luminous Nine</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Trials&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Jedi&#95;9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Trials_of_the_Jedi-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Republic\" title=\"Galactic Republic\">Galactic Republic</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Light&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Jedi&#95;6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Light_of_the_Jedi-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"masters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Masters</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cherff_Maota\" title=\"Cherff Maota\">Cherff Maota</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Rising&#95;Storm&#95;10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Rising_Storm-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><small><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Character\">[Source]</a></span></small><br /></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>Whenever you feel alone&#8230;whenever darkness closes in&#8230;hear our signal and know that the Force is with you. This is our promise. This is our covenant. For light and life&#8230;</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Avar Kriss, during the dedication of the Starlight Beacon<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-The&#95;High&#95;Republic&#95;1&#95;11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-The_High_Republic_1-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p><b>Avar Kriss</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gender\" title=\"Gender\">female</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Master\" title=\"Jedi Master\">Jedi Master</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order\" title=\"Jedi Order\">Jedi Order</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Republic_Era\" title=\"High Republic Era\">High Republic Era</a>. Noble and selfless, Kriss was an inspiration to many of her fellow <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi\" title=\"Jedi\">Jedi</a>. She served on the <a href=\"/wiki/Starlight_Beacon\" title=\"Starlight Beacon\">Starlight Beacon</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Space_station\" title=\"Space station\">space station</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Frontier\" title=\"Galactic Frontier\">frontier</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/The_galaxy\" title=\"The galaxy\">the galaxy</a>. Kriss was heavily involved in the aftermath of the <a href=\"/wiki/Hyperspace\" title=\"Hyperspace\">hyperspace</a> catastrophe known as the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Hyperspace_Disaster\" title=\"Great Hyperspace Disaster\">Great Hyperspace Disaster</a>, when the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Legacy_Run\" title=\"Legacy Run\">Legacy Run</a></i> split apart in hyperspace, causing fragments of the ship to crash through the <a href=\"/wiki/Hetzal_system\" title=\"Hetzal system\">Hetzal system</a> at incredible speeds, coordinating the effort to protect the <a href=\"/wiki/Star_system\" title=\"Star system\">star system</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Hyperspace_anomaly\" title=\"Hyperspace anomaly\">hyperspace anomalies</a>. In the aftermath of the incident, Kriss worked with <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Knight\" title=\"Jedi Knight\">Jedi Knight</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Elzar_Mann\" title=\"Elzar Mann\">Elzar Mann</a>, her best friend from her days at the <a href=\"/wiki/Imperial_Palace\" title=\"Imperial Palace\">Jedi Temple</a>, to discover how the accident occurred as well as research how to stop the continued <a href=\"/wiki/Emergences\" title=\"Emergences\">Emergences</a>, where pieces of the <i>Legacy Run</i> emerged from hyperspace to cause damage across the galaxy.\n</p><p>Kriss was successful in her command of the operation and eventually was given control of Starlight Beacon after it became operational. After helping to put a stop to the <a href=\"/wiki/Drengir_crisis\" title=\"Drengir crisis\">Drengir crisis</a>, Kriss helped lead the Republic's <a href=\"/wiki/Operation:_Counterstrike\" title=\"Operation: Counterstrike\">response</a> to the <a href=\"/wiki/Nihil\" title=\"Nihil\">Nihil</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate\" title=\"Pirate\">marauders</a> who had caused the Great Hyperspace Disaster in the first place. As the <a href=\"/wiki/Nihil_conflict\" title=\"Nihil conflict\">Nihil conflict</a> dragged on, Kriss continued to put pressure on herself and began to give into her anger. Her efforts led to the <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_for_No-Space\" title=\"Battle for No-Space\">Battle for No-Space</a>, in which Kriss, overcome with rage, tried to execute Nihil <a href=\"/wiki/Tempest_Runner\" title=\"Tempest Runner\">Tempest Runner</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Lourna_Dee\" title=\"Lourna Dee\">Lourna Dee</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Date-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Date_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Timelines\" title=\"Star Wars: Timelines\">Star Wars: Timelines</a></i> dates the events of <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_High_Republic:_Light_of_the_Jedi\" title=\"The High Republic: Light of the Jedi\">The High Republic: Light of the Jedi</a></i> to <a href=\"/wiki/232_BBY\" title=\"232 BBY\">232 BBY</a>. As <i>Light of the Jedi</i> establishes Avar Kriss to be around thirty <a href=\"/wiki/Standard_year\" title=\"Standard year\">years</a> old, she must have been <a href=\"/wiki/Reproduction\" title=\"Reproduction\">born</a> around <a href=\"/wiki/262_BBY\" title=\"262 BBY\">262 BBY</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Databank-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Databank_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Databank_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"mti\"><span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Databank_(2014-)\" title=\"Databank (2014-)\"><img alt=\"StarWars-DatabankII\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/db/StarWars-DatabankII.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/13?cb=20140701201231\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"StarWars-DatabankII.png\" data-image-key=\"StarWars-DatabankII.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.starwars.com/databank/avar-kriss\">Avar Kriss</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Databank_(2014-)\" title=\"Databank (2014-)\">Databank</a> <small>(<a targ